# CASM progress-indication Increment 8 trusted reference: casmpgblank
#
# Independently hand-derived, NOT produced by CASM. casmpgblank.seq
# interleaves blank lines and comment-only lines among exactly 5 NOP
# statements, all after ".ORG $C000". Blank and comment lines produce a
